 peacock spider names should feel natural and joyful every time you call your pet.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Choose a name with clear consonant sounds that your spider can easily distinguish from background noise and everyday conversation.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Consider your spider's personality before finalizing. The most popular peacock name is the one that genuinely matches who your companion actually is.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Test your top three choices for a few days each. The name that consistently feels right during feeding, play, and cuddle time is your winner.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Involve your whole household in the decision. A popular peacock spider name should resonate with everyone who will use it daily for years to come.\"}]]}]]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 mb-8 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\",\"children\":\"Save This Idea\"}],[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/pins/500-popular-peacock-spider-names.png\",\"alt\":\"500 Popular Peacock Spider Names\",\"className\":\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl mx-auto shadow-md\",\"style\":{\"maxHeight\":\"400px\"}}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-3\",\"children\":[\"Pin this \",\"popular peacock\",\" \",\"spider\",\" names collection to your Pinterest board\"]}]]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\",\"children\":[\"🔗 Related \",\"Spider\",\" Name Collections\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:gri